# .secrets-allowlist — narrow documented exceptions for secret-scrub.py.
# One regex per line, matched against the full line. Use sparingly.
#
# 2026-10-08 (wave-29, d1-burn-codefixes): worker.js uses `/* ---...--- */`
# comment separators (70 dashes) as section banners. LONG_PAT matches runs
# of [-A-Za-z0-9_.~+/=]{32,}, so every banner trips it. A banner line is
# exactly "/* " + 64+ dashes + " */" — that shape cannot be credential
# material (no key charset, fixed banner shape). Narrow exception below.
^/\* -{64,} \*/$
